OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786565893
OL,3,CMan arrested on suspicion of murder
OL,4,Cafter incident
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof murder after a man was found dead.
OL,9,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP) were
OL,10,Fcalled to a disturbance at around
OL,11,F5.19am on Wednesday, 12 August in
OL,12,FKempster Gardens, Salford.
OL,14,FEmergency services attended and a man
OL,15,Fin his 30s was pronounced dead at the
OL,16,Fscene.
OL,18,FA man, also aged in his 30s, remains
OL,19,Fin police custody for questioning.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/3
