OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786565893
OL,3,CMan arrested on suspicion of murder
OL,4,Cafter incident
OL,6,FSenior Investigating officer,
OL,7,FDetective Superintendent Jen
OL,8,FTattersall, said: "We understand this
OL,9,Fwill be a shock to the community after
OL,10,Fa man has sadly lost his life in the
OL,11,Fearly hours of this morning.
OL,13,F"Our thoughts are with the man's
OL,14,Ffamily and loved ones at this
OL,15,Fdifficult time.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/3
