FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786565893
OL,3,CMan arrested on suspicion of murder
OL,4,Cafter incident
OL,6,F"We have arrested a man on suspicion
OL,7,Fof murder, and he remains in police
OL,8,Fcustody. We are not looking for any
OL,9,Ffurther suspects and believe this was
OL,10,Fan isolated incident with no wider
OL,11,Fthreat to the community.
OL,13,F"Investigators are working around the
OL,14,Fclock to establish the circumstances
OL,15,Fwhich lead to this incident. There
OL,16,Fwill be a noticeable presence of
OL,17,Fofficers deployed to the area while we
OL,18,Fcontinue with our investigation in the
OL,19,Fcoming days. If you have any concerns,
OL,20,Fplease do not hesitate to chat with
OL,21,Fthem."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/3
